      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "hi, I'm glad you could make it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.5,
      "end_seconds": 9.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.37,
      "end_seconds": 13.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "you came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.72,
      "end_seconds": 17.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.45,
      "end_seconds": 21.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.47,
      "end_seconds": 25.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I've been needing to wear a pad"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.15,
      "end_seconds": 31.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Let's do your observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.54,
      "end_seconds": 39.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.63,
      "end_seconds": 62.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 122 over 79, pulse 80, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.12,
      "end_seconds": 63.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "And then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.5,
      "end_seconds": 69.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.57,
      "end_seconds": 74.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.62,
      "end_seconds": 80.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.28,
      "end_seconds": 95.93,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "It usually comes with leaking urine when I cough or sneeze. The leaking urine when I cough or sneeze? That's been for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.98,
      "end_seconds": 102.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.49,
      "end_seconds": 117.78,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "it's a couple of times a week oh, and a heavy dragging feeling low down as for heavy dragging feeling low down, mild, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.73,
      "end_seconds": 126.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Have you had any burning when passing urine, difficulty emptying or constipation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.5,
      "end_seconds": 132.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.75,
      "end_seconds": 138.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Hm, okay. And what about fever or blood in the urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.0,
      "end_seconds": 142.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Right, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.33,
      "end_seconds": 146.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.01,
      "end_seconds": 148.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.76,
      "end_seconds": 155.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.05,
      "end_seconds": 169.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while. I've had diabetes for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.43,
      "end_seconds": 175.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.83,
      "end_seconds": 195.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Any relatives with health problems I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.09,
      "end_seconds": 199.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "my father had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.69,
      "end_seconds": 204.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Have you had to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.82,
      "end_seconds": 210.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Yes, I had a knee arthroscopy, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.56,
      "end_seconds": 225.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.45,
      "end_seconds": 230.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, no allergies to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.04,
      "end_seconds": 232.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.44,
      "end_seconds": 238.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.81,
      "end_seconds": 242.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.23,
      "end_seconds": 249.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.3,
      "end_seconds": 252.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "what do you do for work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.97,
      "end_seconds": 259.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I work in an office, mostly sitting at a desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.34,
      "end_seconds": 263.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "how do you eat, generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.07,
      "end_seconds": 267.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I skip breakfast most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.82,
      "end_seconds": 272.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "what medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.8,
      "end_seconds": 290.24,
      "duration_seconds": 16.44,
      "text": "I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure. I'm on Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I'd been on telmisartan, not any more though, I stopped"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.01,
      "end_seconds": 294.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, a quick examination now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.0,
      "end_seconds": 297.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.18,
      "end_seconds": 300.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "almost done with this part"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.19,
      "end_seconds": 320.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "No bulge is visible when you cough, and the tummy is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.06,
      "end_seconds": 324.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "okay, finished"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.77,
      "end_seconds": 371.08,
      "duration_seconds": 30.31,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I don't have a clear answer today: stress urinary incontinence is possible, and so is an overactive bladder. I think a bladder diary makes sense here, for urinary symptoms. I'm gonna order a urine test, for urinary leakage. Pelvic floor exercises, three sets a day, make a real difference over a couple of months. See me again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.02,
      "end_seconds": 374.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "That works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.8,
      "end_seconds": 378.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.23,
      "end_seconds": 381.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "thank you for your time"
    }
  ]
}